<title>CANADA: MacBlo sees 1998 sales topping C$6.0 bln.</title>
<headline>MacBlo sees 1998 sales topping C$6.0 bln.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Forestry firm MacMillan Bloedel Ltd said on Wednesday that it forecast 1998 sales will surpass C$6.0 billion.</p>
<p>&quot;Our sales have grown from C$3.0 billion to C$5.0 billion today and will exceed C$6.0 billion in 1998,&quot; said Chief Executive Robert Findlay in a text prepared for the annual meeting.</p>
<p>((Vancouver Bureau 604-664-7314))</p>
</text>
